  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. ÷ and - \n\n20 + __**34 ÷ 81**__ × 9 - 2 = 36\n\n⇒ 20 + __**0.41 × 9**__ - 2 = 36\n\n⇒ __**20 + 3.69**__ - 2 = 36\n\n⇒ __**23.69**____** - 2**__&",
